    "name": "Indico REST Authentication Storage API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "REST API for the Indico intelligent document processing / intelligent process automation (IPA) platform. Submit documents to workflows, poll for submission status, retrieve extraction results, and manage review. Captured faithfully from the published Indico developer reference; request/response schemas are modeled from the documented parameters and responses. The platform is typically deployed per-customer on a dedicated cluster; the default hosted cluster host is app.indico.io and the REST API is served under the /restapi base path.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Indico Data Developer Support",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
